# Publish only the Dart library and package metadata. The Go sources,
# generators, CLI, benchmarks, tests and the native_internal plugin are
# consumed as the Go module (github.com/nosuta/godash/v2), not from pub.
#
# NOTE: when .pubignore exists, pub uses it INSTEAD OF .gitignore, so this
# file must also exclude local build output (build/, .dart_tool/, ...).
/*
!/lib/
!/pubspec.yaml
!/LICENSE
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/README.md
